// cannot serve as an orthography→IPA referee. Unlike Bhojpuri this is NOT circular (Umbundu is a distinct, well-
// documented language, not a clone), so the hand-adjudicated gold in test/umbundu.test.ts is a MEANINGFUL correctness
// anchor — the Igbo/Naija no-referee pattern. 🔷 single-source.
